0 FILE 10183 - 18 - Tram 2.ldr
0 Red and white tram/streetcar on a 6x24 train base: glazed side walls of train windows with clear glass, brown minifig seats inside, four end doors, sloped red front and rear cabs with windscreens and wipers, end walls with destination signs and yellow headlights, curved black roof with grille vents and a clip-bar pantograph, underside chassis detailing, mounted on two single-axle train wheel bogies
0 Name: 10183 - 18 - Tram 2.ldr
0 Author: Bert Van Raemdonck [BEAVeR]
